This product bundles a snapshot of the Public Suffix List
(src/shared/psl-data.json), maintained by Mozilla and the PSL community at
https://publicsuffix.org/, distributed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0
(https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). The snapshot is data only and is refreshed
with scripts/fetch-psl.mjs.

This product bundles two font families, both distributed under the SIL Open
Font License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). The font files are
woff2 builds taken unmodified from the fonts' @fontsource packages, in the
Latin and Latin Extended subsets, and no font is fetched at run time.

